{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hart Everest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hart Everest</strong> is an extreme climbing challenge that pushes your patience, reflexes, and balance to the absolute limit. <br>You\u2019ll face the impossible \u2014 a vertical mountain <strong>77 meters higher than Mount Everest</strong> \u2014 and only the most determined climbers will reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb a near-vertical mountain with pure skill and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>rest points</strong> to recover and plan your next move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the <strong>swinging hammers</strong> \u2014 one hit, and your climb <strong>resets from the very beginning</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you slip and start falling, grab onto a <strong>ledge</strong> fast to save yourself. <br>Miss it\u2026 and you\u2019ll <strong>fall all the way down.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics-based climbing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense, patience-testing single climb experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic rest points and deadly obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric visuals and high-altitude feeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall teaches you something new \u2014 every climb brings you closer to mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the top won\u2019t be easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once you conquer <strong>Hart Everest</strong>, the view is all yours.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2999880?t=1762596553","background_raw":"https:/