ience-testing single climb experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic rest points and deadly obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric visuals and high-altitude feeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall teaches you something new \u2014 every climb brings you closer to mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the top won\u2019t be easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once you conquer <strong>Hart Everest</strong>, the view is all yours.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","developers":["U\u011eUR KIZMAZ","BATUHAN G\u00dcLER"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999880/7e82008395533af0a53e99a6d50ee794ef19b1f2/header.jpg?t=1762596553","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2999880/6674396/614f3c8c949c5ae9191674afbf4f4f65dd4c1421/1762594627/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762596551","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2999880/6674396/614f3c8c949c5ae9191674afbf4f4f65dd4c1421/1762594627/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762596551","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2999880/6674396/614f3c8c949c5ae9191674afbf4f4f65dd4c1421/1762594627/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762596551","id":257223719,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223719/movie480.mp4?t=1762596551","max":"https://video.akamai.s